sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client
    participant Server
    participant Database

    User->>Client: Enters credentials
    Client->>Server: POST /login {username, password}
    activate Server
    Server->>Database: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?
    activate Database
    Database-->>Server: User data (or null)
    deactivate Database
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK / 401 Unauthorized
    deactivate Server
    Client->>User: Displays success / error message